unlearned, -nt.

See LEARN. article may serve for this pair also; ‘}

unless & until. for other such duplications; one of the conjunctions is always superfluous, as in the still commoner iF & WHEN, the discussion in which | but a few quotations will allow the reader to judge whether ‘ unless &’ | might not in each be left out with:
