**unless & until.** See ^^PLEONASM^^, 2, for other such duplications; one of the conjunctions is always superfluous, as in the still commoner ^^IF^^ & ^^WHEN^^, the discussion in which article may serve for this pair also; but a few quotations will allow the reader to judge whether ' unless &' might not in each be left out with
